OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears over drought-affected
OL,4,Asports pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Seeing the football pitches in the
OL,7,Fcondition they're in now is tough,"
OL,8,Fsaid Andrew Briggs, Head of of
OL,9,FOperations at Central Swindon North
OL,10,FParish Council, which recently spent
OL,11,F#35,000 on improving the grass pitches
OL,12,Fat the town's Moredon Sporting Hub.
